  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 901.03 Standard Terms. Any terms used in this part that are subject to Env-Dw 101.03 or that are defined in Env-Dw 103 shall have the meaning established therein.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at part heading for Env-Dw 901) #8747, eff 10-28-06; ss by #10749, eff 12-19-14; ss by #14296, eff 6-27-25, EXPIRES: 6-27-35",
